WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.560
Guess who is in the Keuf Magazine cover again?

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.560
-Hey, look. Handless drive.
-STOP IT!!!

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.360
I order you that you had better be safe, after transferring to the new station.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:14.080
Go to Marseille.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:14.960
Marseille in the south?

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.360
Music: L'Algérino - "Va Bene"

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:18.860
Get used to it?

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:19.940
Yes.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.240
Didn't I mean you like this place?

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.900
Don't be so serious.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.260
I've been callous in the Special Police Squad before.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.760
Hey! Pull over!

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.740
Are you crazy? You just hit a cop!

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:32.960
He wanted to stand on the center of the road.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.280
Is that car from his house?

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:42.900
I won't fine you if you take that taxi back.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.200
How about grouping into a team?

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.100
Just like Bad Boy.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.000
Music: The Black Eyed Peas - "Pump It"

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:47.920
Is that real?

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.260
This's the amazing car in Marseille.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:54.660
Then no shifter?

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.400
You make me have pressure. Stop doing this, or I can't concentrate.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.260
Move. I'll drive.

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:03.640
Music: The Black Eyed Peas - "Pump It"

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:05.280
WE HAVE AN EMERGENCY!!!

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:08.820
We finally have this way done!

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:12.000
We now have a big trouble.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.100
Wanna play with me?

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:14.060
The goddamn Italians.

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:14.980
Bring it on.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.120
This mission is to

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:18.140
Get Mafias.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:18.680
"The craziest taxi driver"

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.560
Recently, we have a suspected Italian called Rachid.

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:21.300
*Wilhelm Scream*

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.840
"5-time horsepower"

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:24.700
We have to repair this car.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:26.580
I want to back on the road.

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:32.640
I love you!

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:37.920
Wow, he's really stupid!

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.520
*screaming*

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:43.300
I calm down!

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:45.620
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:47.500
-No, no, no, no, no!
-Stop messing with this guy. (x2)

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:49.220
No matter what, just give me a dozen.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:54.360
Pre-out on April 7 in Marseille
Out nationally on April 11

